flowchart TD
 A[Check Answer] --> B[Validate learner session and question ID]
 B --> C[ExecutionRouter]
 C --> D[Beginner: bounded AST executor]
 C --> E[Advanced: Docker sandbox]
 D --> F{Infrastructure failure?}
 E --> F
 F -->|Yes| G[Return environment error without rewards]
 F -->|No| H[Compare actual outputs with test fixtures]
 H --> I[Verify required Python concepts]
 I --> J[Determine correctness]
 J --> K[Deduplicate attempts and rewards]
 K --> L[Calculate feedback, score and mastery]
 L --> M[Persist attempt and eligible rewards]
 M --> N[Show feedback and companion reaction]
